.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Har du en tax är du varmt välkommen att gå med i paraden.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Även du utan hund eller annan ras är självklart välkommen att titta och heja på oss.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;;\">🐾</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;;\">🚐</span>&nbsp;Bil- och husbilsparkering finns nära området.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;;\">🍴</span>&nbsp;Många mysiga restauranger och glasskiosker finns längs havet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><i>Ett perfekt stopp på sommarresan!</i><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Även hundbad i Öresund finns i närheten&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;;\">❤️</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Mer information finns på Facebook: @Taxparaden Helsingborg</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>'),(30117,745,'_occasions_0_description','field_68dd084d90dc7'),(30118,745,'occasions','1'),(30119,745,'_occasions','field_68d28f0c845d0'),(30120,745,'attendancemode','offline'),(30121,745,'_attendancemode','field_696e24e5660ed'),(30122,745,'locationName','Gröningen, korsningen Tågagatan 1 / Båthusgatan 1 Helsingborg'),(30123,745,'_locationName','field_696e24e566ca3'),(30124,745,'locationAddress','a:13:{s:7:\"address\";s:88:\"1, Båthusgatan, Centrum, Helsingborg, Helsingborgs kommun, Skåne län, 252 67, Sverige\";s:3:\"lat\";d:56.0514784;s:3:\"lng\";d:12.6852461;s:4:\"zoom\";i:15;s:8:\"place_id\";N;s:13:\"street_number\";s:1:\"1\";s:11:\"street_name\";s:12:\"Båthusgatan\";s:4:\"city\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"state\";s:11:\"Skåne län\";s:9:\"post_code\";s:6:\"252 67\";s:7:\"country\";s:7:\"Sverige\";s:13:\"country_short\";s:2:\"SE\";s:16:\"address_locality\";s:19:\"Helsingborgs kommun\";}'),(30125,745,'_locationAddress','field_696e24e567083'),(30126,745,'audience','a:5:{i:0;s:2:\"45\";i:1;s:2:\"84\";i:2;s:2:\"38\";i:3;s:2:\"42\";i:4;s:2:\"83\";}'),(30127,745,'_audience','field_68d28f55f277e'),(30128,745,'category','a:5:{i:0;s:2:\"87\";i:1;s:2:\"72\";i:2;s:3:\"113\";i:3;s:3:\"117\";i:4;s:3:\"125\";}'),(30129,745,'_category','field_68d28f55f2378'),(30130,745,'images','a:2:{i:0;s:3:\"746\";i:1;s:3:\"747\";}'),(30131,745,'_images','field_68d28e8bc7a4e'),(30132,748,'hidden_post_status_condition','public'),(30133,748,'_hidden_post_status_condition','field_67124199dcb25'),(30134,748,'hidden_validation',''),(30135,748,'_hidden_validation','field_654a2a58ca4e9'),(30136,748,'submitNewOrganization','0'),(30137,748,'_submitNewOrganization','field_68d29c329a1ee'),(30138,748,'organization','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"47\";}'