 evenemanget här!</strong>'),(38384,909,'_formSteps_0_formStepContent','field_6627a6e112424'),(38385,909,'formSteps_0_formStepGroup','a:2:{i:0;s:10:\"post_title\";i:1;s:12:\"post_content\";}'),(38386,909,'_formSteps_0_formStepGroup','field_6627a6f212425'),(38387,909,'formSteps_0_formStepIncludesPostTitle','0'),(38388,909,'_formSteps_0_formStepIncludesPostTitle','field_664dea524e1e2'),(38389,909,'formSteps_1_formStepTitle','Arrangör'),(38390,909,'_formSteps_1_formStepTitle','field_6627a6b312423'),(38391,909,'formSteps_1_formStepContent','<p class=\"p1\">Ange vem som arrangerar evenemanget. Informationen gör det tydligt för besökare vem som står bakom evenemanget och vem de kan kontakta vid frågor.</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(38392,909,'_formSteps_1_formStepContent','field_6627a6e112424'),(38393,909,'formSteps_1_formStepGroup','a:1:{i:0;s:19:\"group_68d28e231bbaa\";}'),(38394,909,'_formSteps_1_formStepGroup','field_6627a6f212425'),(38395,909,'formSteps_1_formStepIncludesPostTitle','0'),(38396,909,'_formSteps_1_formStepIncludesPostTitle','field_664dea524e1e2'),(38397,909,'formSteps_2_formStepTitle','Bilder'),(38398,909,'_formSteps_2_formStepTitle','field_6627a6b312423'),(38399,909,'formSteps_2_formStepContent','Få ditt evenemang att sticka ut genom att ladda upp högupplösta bilder. Din evenemangsbild är ofta det första deltagarna lägger märke till, så välj visuella element som fångar uppmärksamhet och väcker intresse. Bilder kommer att visas i den ordning de laddas upp.\r\n\r\n<strong>Rekommenderat format: 16:9.\r\n\r\nJust nu visas bara en bild. </strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(38400,909,'_formSteps_2_formStepContent','field_6627a6e112424'),(38401,909,'formSteps_2_formStepGroup','a:1:{i:0;s:19:\"group_68d28e8bc6408\";}'),(38402,909,'_formSteps_2_formStepGroup','field_6627a6f212425'),(38403,909,'formSteps_2_formStepIncludesPostTitle','0'),(38404,909,'_formSteps_2_formStepIncludesPostTitle','field_664dea524e1e2'),(38405,909,'formSteps','7'),(38406,909,'_formSteps','field_6627a5e312422'),(38407,909,'activeHandlers','a:1:{i:0;s:11:\"WpDbHandler\";}'),(38408,909,'_activeHandlers','field_68258f85a4ad6'),(38409,909,'hasSummaryStep','1'),(38410,909,'_hasSummaryStep','field_664de6eb4fffd'),(38411,909,'summaryTitle',''),(38412,909,'_summaryTitle','field_664de74a4fffe'),(38413,909,'summaryLead',''),(38414,909,'_summaryLead','field_664de76b4ffff'),(38415,909,'isPublicForm','1'),(38416,909,'_isPublicForm','field_662a6557a687b'),(38417,909,'lang','auto'),(38418,909,'_lang','field_636e42408367e'),(38419,909,'hide_in_menu','0'),(38420,909,'_hide_in_menu','field_56d83d2777785'),(38421,909,'custom_menu_title',''),(38422,909,'_custom_menu_title','field_56d83d4e77786'),(38423,909,'post_single_show_featured_image','0'),(38424,909,'_post_single_show_featured_image','field_56c33e148efe3'),(38425,909,'post_one_page_show_title','0'),(38426,909,'_post_one_page_show_title','field_64f8759c6a2a2'),(38427,909,'post_table_of_contents','0'),(38428,909,'_post_table_of_contents','field_68651a9b0c6ac'),(38429,909,'saveToPostType','event'),(38430,909,'_saveToPostType','field_6627a79912426'),(38431,909,'WpDbHandlerConfig_saveToPostTypeStatus','draft'),(38432,909,'_WpDbHandlerConfig_saveToPostTypeStatus','field_662a4f4d25fe6'),(38433,909,'WpDbHandlerConfig',''),(38434,909,'_WpDbHandlerConfig','field_6825a840a064b'),(38435,909,'dataProcessingCategories','a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"7\";}'),(38436,909,'_dataProcessingCategories','field_69287218405e9'),(38437,909,'dataProcessingProcessors','a:2:{i:0;s:1:\"8\";i:1;s:1:\"9\";}'),(38438,909,'_dataProcessingProcessors','field_69287054405e8'),(38439,909,'dataProcessingRetentionTime','90'),(38440,909,'_dataProcessingRetentionTime','field_69286e646e007'),(38441,909,'icon_icon_material_icon',''),(38442,909,'_icon_icon_material_icon','field_63fc769b3c451'),(38443,909,'formSteps_0_formStepIcon','event'),(38444,909,'_formSteps_0_formStepIcon','field_696ddb068d230'),(38445,909,'formSteps_1_formStepIcon','person_raised_hand'),(38446,909,'_formSteps_1_formStepIcon','field_696ddb068d230'),(38447,909,'formSteps_2_formStepIcon','animated_images'),(38448,909,'_formSteps_2_formStepIcon','field_696ddb068d230'),(38449,909,'formSteps_3_formStepIcon','nest_clock_farsight_analog'),(38450,909,'_formSteps_3_formStepIcon','field_696ddb068d230'),(38451,909,'formSteps_3_formStepTitle','Tid'),(38452,909,'_formSteps_3_formStepTitle','field_6627a6b312423'),(38453,909,'formSteps_3_formStepContent','<p class=\"p1\">Ange när evenemanget äger rum antingen som enstaka tillfällen, eller som en serie av tidpunkter. Tydlig information om datum och tid hjälper besökare att planera sitt deltagande.</p>\r\n<strong>Vid återkommande evenemang väljer du veckodag, samt med vilken veckointervall händelsen inträffar. 1 motsvarar varje vecka. 2 varannan vecka. 3 var tredje vecka osv.</strong>\r\n\r\nDatum-intervallet är intervallet när evenemangsserien börjar till när evenemangsserien slutar.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(38454,909,'_formSteps_3_formStepContent','field_6627a6e112424'),(38455,909,'formSteps_3_formStepGroup','a:1:{i:0;s:19:\"group_68d28f0c82ff4\";}'),(38456,909,'_formSteps_3_formStepGroup','field_6627a6f212425'),(38457,909,'formSteps_4_formStepIcon','pin_drop'),(38458,909,'_formSteps_4_formStepIcon','field_696ddb068d230'),(38459,909,'formSteps_4_formStepTitle','Plats'),(38460,909,'_formSteps_4_formStepTitle','field_6627a6b312423'),(38461,909,'formSteps_4_formStepContent','<p class=\"p1\">Här anger du var evenemanget äger rum. Genom att fylla i platsinformation hjälper du besökare att enkelt förstå var evenemanget hålls och hur de tar sig dit. Du kan välja mellan att evenemanget sker online, eller en fysisk plats. Evenemanget måste vara öppet för alla.</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(38462,909,'_formSteps_4_formStepContent','field_6627a6e112424'),(38463,909,'formSteps_4_formStepGroup','a:1:{i:0;s:19:\"group_696e24e564997\";}'),(38464,909,'_formSteps_4_formStepGroup','field_6627a6f212425'),(38465,909,'formSteps_5_formStepIcon','money_range'),(38466,909,'_formSteps_5_formStepIcon','field_696ddb068d230'),(38467,909,'formSteps_5_formStepTitle','Kostnad'),(38468,909,'_formSteps_5_formStepTitle','field_6627a6b312423'),(38469,909,'formSteps_5_formStepContent','Om ditt evenemang har en inträdesavgift eller på något annat sätt tar ut en avgift från deltagarna anger du det här.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(38470,909,'_formSteps_5_formStepContent','field_6627a6e112424'),(38471,909,'formSteps_5_formStepGroup','a:1:{i:0;s:19:\"group_6970c90e6e6ba\";}'),(38472,909,'_formSteps_5_formStepGroup','field_6627a6f212425'),(38473,909,'formSteps_6_formStepIcon','target'),(38474,909,'_formSteps_6_formStepIcon','field_696ddb068d230'),(38475,909,'formSteps_6_formStepTitle','Målgrupp & Kategori'),(38476,909,'_formSteps_6_formStepTitle','field_6627a6b312423'),(38477,909,'formSteps_6_formStepContent','<p class=\"p1\">Ange kompletterande information om evenemanget, såsom målgrupp, kategori och tillgänglighet. Uppgifterna används för att göra evenemanget lättare att hitta, förstå och ta del av för alla besökare.</p>\r\nVill du lägga till en målrupp, kategori eller tillgänglighet som inte redan finns? Maila <a href=\"mailto:dennis.camitz@helsingborg.se\">dennis.camitz@helsingborg.se</a>.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(38478,909,'_formSteps_6_formStepContent','field_6627a6e112424'),(38479,909,'formSteps_6_formStepGroup','a:1:{i:0;s:19:\"group_68d28f55ef8cf\";}'),(38480,909,'_formSteps_6_formStepGroup','field_6627a6f212425'),(38481,910,'submitNewOrganization','0'),(38482,910,'_submitNewOrganization','field_68d29c329a1ee'),(38483,910,'organization','a:1:{i:0;s:3:\"137\";}'),(38484,910,'_organization','field_68d28e231ee5d'),(38485,910,'url','https://vardochomsorg.helsingborg.se/senior/traffpunkter/traffpunkternas-sommarprogram-2026/'),(38486,910,'_url','field_69c4f5e8b7e72'),(38487,910,'[field_68d28f0c845d0','a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:19:\"field_68d28f0c8845b\";s:6:\"byWeek\";s:19:\"field_68d28f0c88f84\";s:28:\"https://schema.org/Wedn